<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">n  nNotes to consolidated Financial Results:    n  n1.tThe Company has consolidated financial results of all its subsidiary companies, joint ventures/ Associates as per Indian Accounting Standard (Ind AS) 110-Consolidated Financial Statements.  n  n2.tWith effect from 01/04/2018, the Company has adopted Ind AS 115 - Revenue from Contracts with Customers, using cumulative effect method, which is applied to contracts that were not completed as of 01/04/2018. Accordingly, the comparatives have not been retrospectively adjusted. The adoption of the standard did not have any material impact on the financial results of the Company.  n  n3.tThe Company has entered into a Scheme of Demerger ('the Scheme') with Aurionpro Solutions Limited (ASL) to transfer in certain businesses. The Scheme was sanctioned by the Hon'ble NCLT, Mumbai Bench vide order dated July 27, 2018 and has filed certified copy of the Order with the office of the Registrar of Companies on August 02, 2018. Accordingly, the effect of the Scheme has been given from March 31, 2017, being the Appointed Date of the Scheme, the Company shall issue new equity shares in the ratio 1:2. Pursuant to the scheme, The Company has considered equity shares capital as on 31st December 2017 and 31st March 2018 in proportionate ratio of equity share capital of ASL as on 31st December 2017 and 31st March 2018.  n  n4.tThe Company operated in Software Consultancy and License business which is the only reportable segment. Therefore, the same has not been separately disclosed in line with provision of Ind AS 108 'Operating Segment'.  n  n5.tOther income includes foreign exchange gain/(loss) of Rs. (516.01) lakhs and Rs. 509.52 lakhs for the quarter and nine months ended 31/12/2018 respectively (for quarter and nine months ended 31/12/2017: Rs. (0.92) lakhs and Rs. (0.79) lakhs respectively).  n  n6.tThe Company's standalone turnover, profit before tax, profit after tax and total comprehensive income is as under:  n       (Rs. in lakhs)  nParticularstQuarter ended 31/12/2018  n(Unaudited)tNine months ended 31/12/2018  n(Unaudited)  nTurnovert736.63t2142.82  nProfit before taxt21.71t1146.63  nProfit after taxt38.31t 865.97  nTotal Comprehensive Incomet39.30t868.91  n  n7.tThe figures for the earlier periods have been regrouped/ reclassified wherever necessary to make them comparable with those of the current period.  n  n8.tThe Statutory Auditors of the Company have conducted a limited review of the consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended 31/12/2018 pursuant to the requirement of Regulation 33 of the SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015. These financial results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and thereafter approved by the Board of Directors at their respective meetings held on 11/02/2019.  n  nttt  nFor Trejhara Solutions Limited  nttt  ntttttttttt      t  nPlace: Navi Mumbait  nDate: February 11, 2019. tttttt                                                    Amit Sheth  n                                                Chairman and Director  n </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
